  549+0000              	;30=speed management: failed, probably Wifi module wrongly set,fix in terminal-add it in the next ver... present in the code but not used
  550+0000              	;31=user defined speed_ AT+UART_CUR command not sent			...???
  551+0000              	;32=user defined routine_ speed in UART not set				...???
  552+0000              	;33=user defined speed_ you try to set nonsence speed (ie. > 23)	...???
  553+0000              	;34= dir retrieve error
